      "kind": "struct",
      "name": "HolderFeePermit",
      "ty_idx": 15,
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "validUntil",
          "ty_idx": 9
        },
        {
          "name": "signature",
          "ty_idx": 16
        }
      ],
      "description": "Backend Ed25519 proof that the offer owner holds PLUSH BRICK. The permit is\ndomain-separated and bound to the network, contract, offer id, owner wallet\nand expiry, so it cannot be replayed for another player or deployment. A\nvalid permit marks the offer fee-exempt: if it wins, no protocol fee is\nwithheld from the payout."
    },
